<Base description="How AI is used on this website" title="AI Usage" url="ai">
    <div class="container">
        <h1 class="heading">AI Usage</h1>
        <div class="content">
            I believe that clankers are important when it comes to research, fact checking and proofreading,
            <br>
            As well as other activities like learning and brainstorming.
            <br>
            <br>
            <strong>However, I will never write content on this site using ai, neither will I send AI generated images on my blogposts and messages..</strong>
            <br>
            <br>
            As <a href="https://cassidoo.co/ai/#:~:text=If%20you%20couldn%E2%80%99t%20be%20bothered%20to%20write%20something%2C%20I%20won%E2%80%99t%20be%20bothered%20to%20read%20it">someone</a> said, "If you couldn't be bothered to write something, I won't be bothered to read it"
            <br>
            <br>
            I respect your time and attention.

            <p class="sub">This was written in accordance with the <a href="https://www.bydamo.la/p/ai-manifesto">ai-manifesto</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Base>

